# Smoke Coverage Audit — Part 4: Domain Priority Targets & Wave 2 Work Plan

File: openOODA/audit/smoke_coverage_audit_part4.oot
Logline: Maps priority targets across Network, Encoding, OS, DB, Compilers, and Domain Tails, establishing the 7-bucket Wave 2 plan.

Setup: Organizes 125 high-leverage target modules into 7 cascading subagent execution buckets.

Beats:
  1. Top-priority network, encoding, parser, and compression modules (25 modules).
  2. Top-priority OS, database, sync, and compiler modules (20 modules).
  3. Top-priority 3D, security, AI, bio, fin, quantum, robotics, and signal targets (16 modules).
  4. Wave 2 work plan: 7 execution buckets across 12 subagent owners.

